Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.83,0:00:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 伟大无敌的拉普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great and mighty Rapu…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们向您祈求水与粮食\N{\fnArial\fs30}we pray to you for water and sustenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.50,0:00:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是为我自己 而是为了我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray to you, not for me, but for my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.79,0:01:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好累\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受尽苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.34,0:02:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.38,0:02:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.77,0:02:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受尽苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.79,0:02:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受尽苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.75,0:03:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.75,0:03:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,它狼吞虎咽我的水果\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gobbling up all my fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.05,0:03:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rapu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,光明使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bringer of Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's one of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.68,0:03:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是格尔 您最后的门徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Gorr, the last of your disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.69,0:03:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去了所有 我的主\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have lost everything, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.77,0:03:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,土地干涸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The land is dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:04:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,生灵涂炭\N{\fnArial\fs30}All life is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对您的信仰未曾动摇 如今就等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}But our faith in you never wavered and now we await the promise…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,您永恒的恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the eternal reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以您才在庆祝吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this why you celebrate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.46,0:04:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以为有永恒的恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks there's an eternal reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.67,0:04:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有永恒的恩典给你 狗东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no eternal reward for you, dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在庆祝刚杀了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we're celebrating is a fresh kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,铲除了死灵剑的持有者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just vanquished the holder of the Necrosword…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.73,0:04:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你受尽苦难　- 免得他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have suffered. - before he could harm…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用那把诅咒之剑杀神　- 如果想复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- any other gods with that cursed blade. - If it's revenge you seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.73,0:04:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他威胁要终结我的帝国\N{\fnArial\fs30}He threatened to end my entire empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.65,0:04:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我的主…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, my lord…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.90,0:04:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的帝国已经终结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your empire has already ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.28,0:04:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人崇拜您了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one left to worship you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.99,0:04:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有更多追随者会取代你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'll be more followers to replace you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.58,0:04:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,源源不绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}There always are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们受苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have suffered…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.21,0:04:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们挨饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we have starved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:04:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter died…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.92,0:05:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以您之名　- 应该的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- in your name. - And well you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你的神受苦是你唯一的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suffering for your gods is your only purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,死后没东西给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing for you after death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.93,0:05:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are no god.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.02,0:05:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定弃绝你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I renounce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你无意义的生命终于有了价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now your meaningless life finally does have a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.16,0:05:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我牺牲你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}To sacrifice yourself to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's revenge you seek…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.25,0:05:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠杀众神\N{\fnArial\fs30}…kill all the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.59,0:05:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,前往永恒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to Eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's revenge you seek…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.01,0:05:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤彩虹桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}summon the Bifrost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,前往永恒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to Eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.93,0:05:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 屠杀众神　- 召唤彩虹桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kill all the gods. - Summon the Bifrost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:05:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,前往永恒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to Eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:06:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠杀众神…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill all the gods. Kill all the gods. Kill all the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把剑选择了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sword chose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你受到了诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are now cursed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉不像诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't feel like a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉像承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels like a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.05,0:06:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的誓约\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is my vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.68,0:06:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,众神将亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}All gods will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 围过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, come, gather round.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来听太空维京人的传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And listen to the legend of the Space Viking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是雷霆之神 又名索尔奥汀森\N{\fnArial\fs30}AKA the God of Thunder. AKA Thor Odinson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.21,0:07:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,从小被当成战士培养\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raised in the way of the warrior…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.37,0:07:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔学习协助打赢战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor was taught to help win battles…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为无力反抗的人打赢正义之战\N{\fnArial\fs30}fighting the good fight for those who can't fight good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一天一天成长茁壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}He grew and he grew and he grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:07:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,体贴敏感 宛如一抹微笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was sensitive, like a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.51,0:08:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的爱心不分贵贱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his loving nature did not discriminate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱过爱到卡惨死的激情女郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He once loved a swashbuckling Passionista.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一次爱上女狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another time, he loved a Wolf Woman…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.07,0:08:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在母狼身上办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a Woman Wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.61,0:08:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但索尔唯一的真爱是地球女人珍芳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Thor's one true love was an Earth woman named Jane Fonda.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.45,0:08:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 珍佛斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. No. Jane Foster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜在爱的战役中 索尔输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sadly, in the battle for love, Thor lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实那段时间他失去许多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, he lost a lot of people in those days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.58,0:08:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的老母\N{\fnArial\fs30}His mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}His dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.55,0:08:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个路人甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whoever that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有海姆达尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Heimdall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.43,0:08:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及他的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.26,0:08:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又是他的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his brother, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.01,0:08:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.10,0:08:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的索尔看着他的星球爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Thor had to watch his planet explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他说：「我做了什么？」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he said, "What have I done?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱的一切和每个人似乎都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seemed that everything and everyone he loved, he lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是他把心藏在庞大的肉身里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so he hid his heart behind a big, fleshy bod…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样心就不会再破碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it could never be broken again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算他不再爱 不代表不再战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just because he was done loving, didn't mean he was done fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他与星际异攻队合体\N{\fnArial\fs30}He teamed up with the Guardians of the Galaxy…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.87,0:09:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,展开经典的索尔大冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}and set off on some classic Thor adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他恢复健美体态\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got in shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拚命锻炼肌肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putting in the hard yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.46,0:09:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,将痛苦化为动力 丝毫不偷懒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turning pains into gains, and never skipping leg day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.26,0:09:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从肥肉老爹变成筋肉男神\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went from Dad Bod to God Bod.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在男神的外表下 还有悲伤的情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But beneath his God Bod, there was still a Sad Bod…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.43,0:09:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要尽情释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}just trying to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为索尔多年来操练的肉身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because all of the bods that Thor had worn over the years…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,都隐藏不了他内心的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't hide the pain that he was feeling on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.57,0:09:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是他放弃寻找爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he gave up his search for love…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.45,0:09:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受自己只擅长一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}accepting that he was only good for one thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.58,0:09:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,静静沉思 等着有人问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting in quiet contemplation for someone to say…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「索尔 我们要你帮忙打赢这场仗」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Thor, we need your help to win this battle."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要你帮忙打赢这场仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help to win this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 走吧 风暴破坏者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Come on, Stormbreaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续上工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶快\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must hurry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人危在旦夕\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.69,0:10:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我 你会弄坏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me those. You're gonna break 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是格鲁特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Groot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面都是你的树汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got sap all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家好　- 唉呀 看是谁来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, everybody. - Well, well, look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家混得还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we doing, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.55,0:10:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,烂透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.34,0:10:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all about to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这星球是悠闲的度假村\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said this planet would be a relaxing holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.26,0:10:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说它会「像个悠闲的度假村」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said it was going to be, "Like a relaxing holiday."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看灿烂的天空 三个土星的太阳\N{\fnArial\fs30}But look at that resplendent skyscape. Three suns of Saturn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.64,0:10:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么比这更悠闲的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could be more relaxing than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的度假村\N{\fnArial\fs30}An actual holiday!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,布斯肯废渣去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die Booskan scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷霆之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}God of Thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:10:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚坎王\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Yakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.28,0:11:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于加入我们的战役\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have finally joined our fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.95,0:11:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,俗话说 迟到总比不到好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as they say, "Better late than not at all."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.78,0:11:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it's very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.54,0:11:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道 我们曾住在和平的绿洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you know, we used to live in a peaceful oasis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.75,0:11:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接着我们的神惨遭杀害　- 杀害？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But then our gods were murdered. - Murdered?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今我们的圣殿无人守护\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now our sacred temple has been left unguarded…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈布斯卡的党羽掌控了它的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Habooska's hordes took control of its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们最神圣的殿堂 他亵渎了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is our most sacred shrine and he desecrates it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嚣张没有落魄的久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚坎王 跟他们说今天这里发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Yakan, tell them what happened here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们索尔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell of the time that Thor…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,和乌合之众组成的三流杂牌军\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his ragtag, motley crew of misfit desperados…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.57,0:11:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,扭转了战争的局势\N{\fnArial\fs30}turned the tide of the battle…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.61,0:11:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让自己名留青史\N{\fnArial\fs30}and etched their names in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.86,0:11:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,情势对我们不利 但我告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the odds may be against us, but I'll tell you this for free…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.53,0:11:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,此时此刻做个了断\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ends here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会进入圣殿吧？不\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not going to go into the temple, is he? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.92,0:13:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全体有功 因为我们团结一心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can collectively take credit for that because we worked as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.55,0:14:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用心和意志击败敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used our hearts and our minds to defeat the enemy…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.51,0:14:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,将损失降至最低\N{\fnArial\fs30}with minimal loss or damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.02,0:14:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,经典的索尔大冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a classic Thor adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.14,0:14:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,万岁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.75,0:14:40.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（佛斯特时空旅行理论）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.96,0:14:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good book?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.55,0:14:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.26,0:14:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wrote it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.47,0:14:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是珍佛斯特博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You're Dr. Jane Foster?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.97,0:14:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好　- 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦罗森桥怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the Einstein-Rosen Bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:14:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对　- 难到爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Really tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要一个3D模型\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… You need a 3D model.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.94,0:15:02.40,Title,0,0,0,0,,看过《撕裂地平线》吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever see Event Horizon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.69,0:15:06.23,Title,0,0,0,0,,- 《星际效应》？　- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Interstellar? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.40,0:15:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那部片解释得很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That movie explains everything really clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 爱因斯坦罗森桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. The Einstein-Rosen Bridge…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.91,0:15:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,折迭空间 所以A点和B点\N{\fnArial\fs30}folds space, so that point A and point B…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,并存在时空中\N{\fnArial\fs30}coexist in space and time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄坏了自己的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just ruined your own book.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在你懂虫洞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but now you understand wormholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找那些电影来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch those movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.30,0:15:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好　- 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.55,0:15:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到辣味芝多司 非买不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw the Hot Cheetos, had to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.77,0:15:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好得不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.11,0:15:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我 有告诉别人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you told anyone else besides me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.16,0:15:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人发现就会开始怪怪的 变得不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}When people find out they start acting weird. They're just different.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:16:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在不需要承受那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need that in my life right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正没那么严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, it's not that serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍 你是第四期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, it's Stage Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,总共有几期？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of, like, how many stages?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,四期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要赶去哪个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you have somewhere else you gotta be right now…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,比化疗更重要吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's more important than chemo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.85,0:16:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想溜回实验室喔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying to get back to the lab, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有几个想法要试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a few ideas I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.07,0:16:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 少来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, no, time out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.49,0:16:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想做实验室的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think your lab work is something you have to do…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.07,0:16:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则会让整个文明世界失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}otherwise you're letting down all of civilization…but.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没搞懂宇宙想给你的讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not getting what the universe is actually trying to tell you…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我翻译给你听\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let me translate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,放慢脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.25,0:16:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要体力才能抗癌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need your energy to fight this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会用自己的方式抗癌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fight it my way, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.05,0:16:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, FYI…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己的方式不等于单独待在实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}"my way" does not have to equal alone in a lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.60,0:17:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你该打出太空维京人牌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's time to play the Space Viking card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.35,0:17:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不算一张牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.64,0:17:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪有什么牌　- 明明有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no card. - There's a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.10,0:17:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,高大金发又俊美\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tall, it's blond, and it's gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅到掉渣牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a handsome card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.19,0:17:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珍 你确定吗？　- 黛西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jane, are you sure? - Look, Darcy…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会自己想清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will figure this out by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:19.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（姓名：珍佛斯特）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.91,0:17:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,检验结果还是一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Results are still coming back the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,化疗看来效果有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid the chemo has very little effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.59,0:17:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果需要帮忙或想聊聊 打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's anything I can do, or if you just wanna talk, call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.27,0:17:53.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（维京神话）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:03.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（雷神之锤是）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:04.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（给他们）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.83,0:18:06.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（耐力与精神）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:08.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（良好健康）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.42,0:18:15.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎光临新阿斯加德 减速慢行）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.38,0:18:16.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（滕斯贝格）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.59,0:18:18.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（新阿斯加德之旅）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,散发王者气息 因为你值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smell like a king, because you're worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.94,0:18:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧仕派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old Spice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.61,0:18:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.45,0:18:48.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（无限寻宝乐园）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.18,0:19:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这里 好美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this place. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.77,0:19:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.19,0:19:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 家 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, home, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.98,0:19:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来带你回家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 回到阿斯加德星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. To planet Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.61,0:19:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德不是星球 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgard is not a planet, my sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.36,0:19:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是一个民族 是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is people. It is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.91,0:19:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 是我进入灵界的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, it is time for me to pass on to the spirit realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.29,0:19:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将进驻…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take my place…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.21,0:19:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,英灵殿的大宴会厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the great banqueting hall of Valhalla…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,众神的安息地\N{\fnArial\fs30}the resting place of the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.63,0:19:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有个姊姊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.09,0:19:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我要变成神仙星尘\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so now, I turn into godly stardust…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.26,0:19:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你们道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}and say farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.31,0:19:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没？开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see? It's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.15,0:19:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm disappearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.11,0:20:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.78,0:20:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.99,0:20:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}But wait! Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.87,0:20:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们身后出现一个不祥的入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}An ominous portal hath appeared behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.62,0:20:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,变身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transform!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.59,0:20:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是海拉 死亡女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Hela, Goddess of Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.43,0:20:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回到阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I return to Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,夺回王位继承人头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stake my claim as the rightful heir to the throne…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都阻止不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no one will stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不屈服就受死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join me or die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝不屈服 女巫…雷神凸锤\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will never join you, witch! Mjolnir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.61,0:20:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我摧毁了你的锤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I broke your hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.66,0:20:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,受死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.24,0:20:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,彩虹桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bifrost!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.38,0:21:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几乎能感受到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can almost feel the power…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.01,0:21:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些美丽静止石头的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}of these magnificent and immovable stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.30,0:21:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们回村里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's head back to the village…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.85,0:21:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝点正宗的阿斯加德蜂蜜酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we can drink some real Asgardian mead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.93,0:21:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.43,0:21:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,灾难之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}God of Disaster…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}we thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们担心少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We feared we would be at war forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.41,0:21:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,众神保护将永无宁日\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the protection of our gods…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 和平将降临\N{\fnArial\fs30}but now, peace shall reign.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.02,0:22:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为报答你的恩情 请接受这些赠礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}In return for your service, please accept these gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.61,0:22:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,依照传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}As is tradition,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.96,0:22:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界的保护者能获赠猛兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}the protectors of our world are bestowed with great beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.08,0:22:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级巨羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giant goats!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.20,0:22:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at those! They are wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.41,0:22:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,寇格 你看 它们真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Korg, look at that. Those things are beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.54,0:22:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚坎王 太谢谢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Yakan, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.79,0:22:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 关于圣殿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, about the temple…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.71,0:22:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想谈圣殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna talk about the temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.05,0:22:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我瞭 但如果要谈…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but if we were to talk about it, I think it's important…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.92,0:22:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会难过　- 对生命和物品…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's making me sad. - …to life and material objects…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很火大　- 我不说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And mad. - Okay, I'll stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.64,0:22:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget the goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接受了 就得带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which you accepted, and now must take with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕不退货\N{\fnArial\fs30}No backsies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.14,0:22:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们真漂亮　- 对 很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They are beautiful. - Yes, they are beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.40,0:22:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也很爱鬼叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}They also scream quite a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.11,0:22:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.98,0:22:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是格鲁特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Groot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.15,0:22:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到遥控器才能下载求救信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find the damn remote so we can download the distress signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.11,0:22:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,回想一下 你把遥控器放哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retrace your steps. Where did you put the remote?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.15,0:22:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概被你的羊吃掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of your goats probably ate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.57,0:22:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,羊没吃遥控器 别鬼扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goats didn't eat the remote. Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.49,0:22:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不伸进去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I ain't digging through their crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.99,0:22:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱它们 它们应该永远陪着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love them! They should live with us forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:22:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到遥控器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found the remote!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.08,0:22:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来解决它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm putting them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.29,0:23:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也来　- 能不能用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me too. - Is it working or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.37,0:23:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用 没充电\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not workin'. It's not charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.92,0:23:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许你该找充电器　- 让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, maybe you need to find a charger… - Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.67,0:23:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey! Whoa, whoa, whoa! Whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.09,0:23:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 寇格 没事吧？　- 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Korg, you okay? - Yeah, bro. All good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.97,0:23:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家放轻松 羊儿不碍事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Everybody, just relax. The goats are gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.64,0:23:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然也能拿来烤…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not, we can just use them for meat…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.06,0:23:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,考验智慧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…ting people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.22,0:23:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,考验智慧 看谁最懂动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meeting people. They're a great conversation starter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.43,0:23:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说吹特殊的口哨能召唤它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've been told you can summon them with a special whistle…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.85,0:23:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吹\N{\fnArial\fs30}that goes something like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.52,0:23:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not it. No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.40,0:23:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 你吹吹看\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not it. You have a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.36,0:23:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.53,0:23:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家好　- 克雷林\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, hey, guys. - Kraglin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.36,0:23:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.49,0:23:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你一直在这里？　- 你叫我待在船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You been here this whole time? - Yeah, you said to stay with the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.24,0:23:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是格兰达 我们结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Glenda. We're married.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.24,0:23:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是格鲁特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Groot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.41,0:23:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是怎么说新恋情的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did we tell you about jumpin' into new relationships?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不应该谈恋爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I shouldn't be doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.58,0:23:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 不能每到新的星球就结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you can't get married on every single planet we land on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.08,0:23:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}（求救信号）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.29,0:23:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是格鲁特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Groot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.55,0:23:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.96,0:23:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 求救信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here we go. Distress calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.34,0:23:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,请救救我们 屠神者发现我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help us! The God Butcher has found us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.30,0:23:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠神者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}God Butcher?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.60,0:23:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他吊死他们 当成警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left them hanging as a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.39,0:23:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些神惨遭杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all of these gods, murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.35,0:24:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最优秀的战士如今成了亡魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our greatest champions, now laid to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.10,0:24:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.44,0:24:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会下这种毒手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who could have done something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.94,0:24:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔 你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.11,0:24:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那是什么？回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. What was that? Go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.19,0:24:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,播放那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.78,0:24:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 索尔 你在哪里？　- 希芙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thor, where are you? - Sif?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.37,0:24:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.37,0:24:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友有危险 得立刻赶过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend is in danger. We must go at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.49,0:24:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动船只 朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start the ship, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.87,0:24:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们该分头行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, maybe we should split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.04,0:24:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多人要救 看这些求救…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many people to save, I mean, look at all of these distress…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.63,0:24:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.01,0:24:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.17,0:24:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会有事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.68,0:24:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欣赏你们对彼此的承诺 很感人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admire your commitment to each other. It's a beautiful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.64,0:24:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我永远不会有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alas, it's something I'll never have.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.43,0:24:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 听我说两句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, if I may…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.39,0:24:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.93,0:24:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,活了几千年\N{\fnArial\fs30}After thousands of years of living,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.29,0:24:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你似乎不了解自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't seem to know who the hell you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.44,0:24:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前也迷惘过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been lost before.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.90,0:24:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我发现了意义 发现爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I found meaning, I found love.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.86,0:24:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去之后真的好痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yeah, it got taken from me, and god, that hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.03,0:24:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那种糟糕的感觉总比空虚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that shitty feeling is better than feeling empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.37,0:25:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你有一天能找到一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hope for you is that one day you will find something…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.33,0:25:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你觉得这么糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make you feel this shitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.71,0:25:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经爱过 却没有结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have loved before. It didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.59,0:25:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们不是惨死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They either die a grismal death.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.20,0:25:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是写信把我甩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or they dump you with a handwritten letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.51,0:25:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道哪种比较惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know which is worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.46,0:25:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才跟人保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's why I keep everyone at arm's length.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.72,0:25:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我太亲近了 我就知道会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've grown too attached. Damn it, I knew this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.01,0:25:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该走了 我去找希芙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must go. I'll find Sif.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们响应其他信号 星际需要异攻队\N{\fnArial\fs30}You answer the other calls. The galaxy needs its Guardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.52,0:25:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 我们离…　- 我知道很痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cool, yeah. We were just leaving… - I know it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.06,0:25:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这样比较好 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's better this way. You have to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.69,0:25:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了抚平伤痛 干脆你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To ease the pain, why don't you…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.36,0:25:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,开走这艘船 当成临别礼物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}take this ship here as a parting farewell gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.66,0:25:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把我的船送给我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're giving me my ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.03,0:25:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 它是你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, she's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.53,0:25:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿你跟我一样与它创造许多回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}May you make as many memories with her as I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.37,0:25:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,它脾气别扭\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a temperamental old lass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.04,0:25:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,危急时尽忠职守\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will serve you well in a tight pickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.50,0:25:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来发动　- 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll start the ship. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.79,0:25:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.30,0:25:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的握手\N{\fnArial\fs30}A human handshake…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.21,0:25:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成阿斯加德式握手\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Asgardian shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.13,0:25:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成你不能相信的蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into the snake that you cannot trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.76,0:25:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖太久尴尬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really dragging this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.01,0:26:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后变成经典的阿斯加德击指\N{\fnArial\fs30}And finish with the classic Asgardian high one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.77,0:26:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.10,0:26:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾我的队员 他们会很辛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of my crew. This is gonna be hard for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.48,0:26:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.65,0:26:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.82,0:26:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.11,0:26:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果感到迷惘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever feel lost…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.36,0:26:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就看着心爱之人的双眸\N{\fnArial\fs30}just look into the eyes of the people that you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.12,0:26:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会让你知道自己是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll tell you exactly who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.50,0:26:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 掰\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.17,0:26:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 珍惜美好的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what it's worth, let's cling to the good memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.17,0:26:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们阿斯加德人都说 「愿你旅行快如奥丁渡鸦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We Asgardians say, "May you travel with the speed of Odin's ravens.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.43,0:26:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们英灵殿见 畅饮蜂蜜酒…」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'll see you in Valhalla where we shall drink mead and…"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.51,0:26:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们走了　- 又落单了 只剩你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're gone. - Alone again. Just me and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.89,0:26:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴破坏者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stormbreaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.94,0:26:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 臭斧头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out, you frickin' crazy axe!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.61,0:26:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办 兄弟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do now, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.03,0:26:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找希芙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go get Sif!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.88,0:27:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东东？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who or what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.88,0:27:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,法利加 法利加人之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Falligar, God of the Falligarians.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.51,0:27:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,会是你见过最善良的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the nicest gods you'll ever meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.09,0:27:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.27,0:27:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,希芙 是我 索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sif, it's me, Thor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.56,0:27:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥汀森？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odinson?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.98,0:27:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你少了一只手臂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're missing an arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.48,0:27:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.65,0:27:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 让我留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.74,0:27:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想以战士之姿死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to die a warrior's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.86,0:27:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,死在战场上 战死沙场\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the battlefield. In battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.07,0:27:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就能入祀英灵殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I can claim my place in Valhalla.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.54,0:27:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在不想吐槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I hate to break it to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.58,0:27:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,战士入祀英灵殿 必须战死沙场\N{\fnArial\fs30}but for a warrior to get into Valhalla, you have to die in the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.25,0:27:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没死　- 靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You survived. - Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.88,0:27:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定你的手臂在英灵殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe your arm is in Valhalla.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.42,0:28:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.22,0:28:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在追捕一个狂人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been hunting a madman.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.80,0:28:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟踪他到这里 但这是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed him here, but it was a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.05,0:28:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个狂人是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this madman?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.64,0:28:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠神者来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The God Butcher is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.02,0:28:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他企图歼灭众神\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seeks the extinction of the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.73,0:28:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德是他下一个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgard is next.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.97,0:29:30.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（枪与玫瑰 九界）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.31,0:29:32.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（大色拉 摇滚节）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.76,0:30:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 是索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's Thor!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.97,0:30:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 索尔　- 带希芙去医务室\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thor! - Take Sif to the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.09,0:30:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.26,0:30:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你惹毛了谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd you piss off now?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.55,0:30:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我的错 我没见过这些玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not my fault. I've never even seen these things…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.22,0:30:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁晓得它们是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever the hell they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.22,0:30:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.83,0:30:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个新来的是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the new guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.46,0:30:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个吗？你会很喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy? You're gonna love that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.68,0:30:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷神之锤…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mjolnir! Mjolnir!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.77,0:31:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, Thor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.98,0:31:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有看到我的锤子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen my hammer?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.81,0:31:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷神之锤 在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mjolnir, here, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.07,0:31:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷神之锤？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mjolnir?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.53,0:31:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷神之锤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mjolnir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.37,0:31:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.54,0:31:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷神之锤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mjolnir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.36,0:31:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.41,0:31:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 你拿的是我的锤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. That's my hammer you've got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.74,0:31:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的造型\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's my look.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.88,0:32:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.21,0:32:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别耍白痴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough tomfoolery.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.55,0:32:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿下面具 露个脸吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take off that mask and reveal yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.88,0:32:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.80,0:32:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.43,0:32:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.15,0:32:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我告诉你们索尔与珍的传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you the legend of Thor and Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.90,0:32:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是雷霆之神 她是女科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a God of Thunder and she, a woman of science.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.16,0:32:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他们来自不同的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And although they were from different worlds…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.37,0:32:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,却还是走在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}somehow, it just made sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.41,0:32:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们共同展开一段爱的旅程\N{\fnArial\fs30}And together they embarked on a journey of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.55,0:32:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔教导珍战士之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor taught Jane the way of the warrior…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.05,0:32:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍教索尔为人之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Jane taught Thor the way of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.39,0:33:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,时光飞逝 他们的爱越来越深\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as time passed, their love grew deeper and deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.77,0:33:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很棒吧 雷神之锤？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's incredible, isn't she, Mjolnir?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.53,0:33:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你答应我 永远保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to promise me you'll always protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.45,0:33:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.95,0:33:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么深刻的爱产生了魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And love that deep has a way of becoming magical.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.25,0:33:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔开始规划未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor set his sights toward a future…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.50,0:33:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象往后的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all it might hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.43,0:33:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他越思考与珍的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the more he pondered a life with Jane,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.25,0:33:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就越怕失去它\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more he feared losing that life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.47,0:33:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管珍不想承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}And although Jane didn't want to admit it…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.97,0:33:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也担心失去这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was scared of loss as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.77,0:33:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是两人之间出现隔阂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, they built walls between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.61,0:33:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}（尼克福瑞）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.90,0:33:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔忙着拯救人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor got busy saving humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.69,0:33:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heimdall!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.16,0:33:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍也忙着做同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Jane got busy doing the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.91,0:34:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.91,0:34:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后两人渐行渐远\N{\fnArial\fs30}And eventually, the space between them grew and grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.02,0:34:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}until it became too wide to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.88,0:34:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,终究得有所取舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something had to give.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.42,0:34:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须熬通宵才能跑完数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to stay up all night to go through this data. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.18,0:34:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我整晚不睡才能清理干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have to stay up all night and clean all of this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.39,0:34:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 才两个盘子　- 两个盘子和两根叉子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's two plates! - It's two plates and two forks!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.85,0:34:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,某天晚上 有人做出了取舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, one night, it did give.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.52,0:34:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍写了一张字条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane wrote a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.40,0:34:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Thor read that note.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.20,0:34:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的传奇顿时成了神话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And their legend suddenly became myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.41,0:34:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他们那么以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or so they thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.62,0:34:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.04,0:34:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好 有点热…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's a little hot in…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.79,0:34:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始觉得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Startin' to feel…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.25,0:34:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,头盔让人幽闭恐惧症发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's claustrophobic with the helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.34,0:35:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.47,0:35:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,能晚点再谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we talk about this later?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.27,0:35:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.43,0:35:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.40,0:35:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.90,0:35:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠杀众神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill all the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.61,0:36:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这是死灵剑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Is that the Necrosword?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.78,0:36:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,超酷 我只在故事里读过\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's cool. I've only ever read about it in stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.45,0:36:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就知道这会很痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you know this is going to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.87,0:36:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.08,0:36:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛苦不过是弱者发明的概念\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is pain but a construct invented by the weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.66,0:36:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 非常利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's very sharp!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.17,0:36:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.05,0:36:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch my things.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.41,0:36:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好快跑 孬种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you better run, you coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.06,0:37:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 它们带走孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The children. They're taking the children!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.40,0:37:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.36,0:37:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.22,0:37:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,阴影怪物 恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shadow monsters. Disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.35,0:37:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕行世界两圈 没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flew around the world twice. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.77,0:37:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些孬种一定跑了 我们会找到它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cowards must have run away. We'll find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.56,0:38:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好特别的重逢方式　- 就是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quite a reunion, huh? - You're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.69,0:38:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,多久了？三、四年？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it been? Like, three, four years?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.82,0:38:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,八年七个月又六天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight years, seven months, and six days.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.32,0:38:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没忘记…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't forgotten…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.53,0:38:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次看到你 或没看到你 你离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the last time I saw you, or didn't see you, because you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.91,0:38:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我离开是过度简化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of an oversimplification to say that I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.79,0:38:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你离开了 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you left. You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.08,0:38:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手写了一封优美的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wrote me a beautiful handwritten letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.08,0:38:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should know, I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.13,0:38:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不在 所以我才写　- 我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You weren't there, actually, hence the note. - I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.80,0:38:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你没看到我离开 或许离开的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you weren't there to see me leave, then maybe it was you that left.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.05,0:38:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair point.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.14,0:38:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不重要啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.76,0:38:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有谁在记这些？　- 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like, who's keeping track, right? - No, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.18,0:38:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都离开 也被离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose we both left and both got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.69,0:38:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你又离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're leaving again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.44,0:38:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,米克 我们需要所有证人的详尽说词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miek, we need detailed accounts from all the witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.40,0:38:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴洛 给我失踪孩童的名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darryl, get me all the names of the children who have been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.28,0:38:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下 我女儿被带走 下落不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, my daughter has been taken, and I don't know where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.78,0:38:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,会找到她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she'll be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.57,0:38:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 他们流血了 快带去医务室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, they're bleeding. Get them to the infirmary. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.37,0:38:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.54,0:38:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下 该筹备这场混乱的戏码吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, should we start working on a performance of this entire debacle?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.50,0:39:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,人民需要娱乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people need entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.17,0:39:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其在这危机当头之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Particularly now, in times of crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.04,0:39:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其这时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Particularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.55,0:39:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听到她说不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not hear a, "No."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.26,0:39:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.63,0:39:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿斯加德 夜景　- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Asgard. Night. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.93,0:39:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,开场是孩子在睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We open on some sleeping children.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.39,0:39:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你前女友吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's the ex-girlfriend, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.98,0:39:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,熟悉的前女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old ex-girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.31,0:39:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱蒂佛斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jodie Foster.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.52,0:39:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍佛斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane Foster.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.65,0:39:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有缘无份的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one that got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.36,0:39:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有缘无份的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one that got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.73,0:39:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那代表逃离\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.90,0:39:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah… Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.94,0:39:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到前女友和前锤子相处融洽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be hard for you to see your ex-girlfriend…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.32,0:39:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your ex-hammer hangin' out, and getting on so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.16,0:39:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you up to, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.46,0:39:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.00,0:39:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来找把拔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.38,0:39:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 雷神之锤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Mjolnir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.96,0:39:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.80,0:39:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.22,0:39:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道我的想法吗？　- 我刚刚呼唤你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know what I think we should do? - I was just calling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.09,0:39:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 组军队　- 怎么组？一半士兵都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Start an army! - With what? Half our soldiers are dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.76,0:39:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总是有一半士兵死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half our soldiers are always dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.43,0:39:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各位 拜托…　- 孩子们呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everyone, please… - Where are the children?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.02,0:40:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家去 我保证很快就有消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}…go home. I promise you we'll have news soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.77,0:40:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,该有人告诉我们怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone needs to tell us what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.40,0:40:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.73,0:40:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不懂　- 你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just don't understand. - You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.23,0:40:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是我们的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all our fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.61,0:40:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.82,0:40:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgard!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.00,0:40:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 我们千万别争吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends, we must not quarrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.75,0:40:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这时候我们需要团结一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}In times like this, we need to unite, come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.96,0:40:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白这里的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see what's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.46,0:40:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.30,0:40:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,担忧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.64,0:40:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.97,0:40:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,焦虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.81,0:40:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要找到孩子 得先深刻自省\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we are to find the children, we must first look within ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.10,0:40:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,米克 振奋人心的演说不要出怪声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Miek, it's very hard to give a rousing speech with the… noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.65,0:40:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？　- 她在做会议纪录\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - She's taking minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.15,0:40:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间做纪录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precious minutes we don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.69,0:40:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要孩子回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the kids back?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.70,0:40:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.45,0:40:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这写下来 米克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can write that down, Miek.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.83,0:41:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.46,0:41:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴破坏者 你在干嘛 因为雷神之锤吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stormbreaker, what are you doing? Is this about Mjolnir?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.76,0:41:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,通通出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, out!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.97,0:41:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.14,0:41:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的披风着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bae, your cape's on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.26,0:41:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 它会长回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine. It'll grow back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.39,0:41:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会开发票给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm invoicing you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.56,0:41:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.94,0:41:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对这家伙了解多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we know about this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.23,0:41:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在阴影间移动　- 用阴影创造怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He travels through shadows. - And he creates monsters with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.15,0:41:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇特无比的怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely freaky monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.86,0:41:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还使用死灵剑 我怎么知道呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also wields the Necrosword. How do I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.90,0:41:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他差点刺中我的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he almost speared me in the face with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.44,0:41:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,死灵剑是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a Necrosword?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.65,0:41:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,自开天辟地就传承下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an ancient weapon that's been passed through hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.66,0:41:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,古老武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}since the dawn of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.87,0:41:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它具有杀神的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has the ability to slay gods…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.37,0:41:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢腐蚀与杀害持有者 也就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it slowly corrupts and kills whoever wields it, which means…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.20,0:41:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以它影响了他　- 对 一定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, it infected him. - It's infecting him. Yes. It must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.34,0:41:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以基本上我们对付的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So basically, we're up against a cursed,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.66,0:41:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个受诅咒的阴影丧尸绑匪\N{\fnArial\fs30}shadow-zombie kidnapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.21,0:41:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒棒 何时出发？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome. When do we leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.80,0:41:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.59,0:41:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看得见我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.80,0:41:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现漂浮头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Floating head alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.14,0:41:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是阿斯翠 海姆达尔的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Astrid. Heimdall's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.14,0:42:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯翠 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astrid, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.93,0:42:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不叫阿斯翠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I no longer go by the name Astrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.10,0:42:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在叫艾克索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm now known as Axl.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.23,0:42:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是地球一个热门乐团的主唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a singer from a popular band I heard on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.52,0:42:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 枪与玫瑰　- 阿斯翠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- G N' R. - Astrid…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.86,0:42:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲给你一个强悍的维京名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}your father gave you a very tough Viking name…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.94,0:42:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要实现他的心愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I intend to honor his wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.61,0:42:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾克索　- 阿斯翠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Axl. - Astrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.74,0:42:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说艾克索　- 阿斯翠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I said Axl. - Astrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.07,0:42:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾克索　- 艾你的头 听他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Axl! - It's asshole. Now listen to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.36,0:42:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 艾克索 你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, fine, Axl. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.12,0:42:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不清楚 我还不会用我的魔眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure. I don't know how to use my magic eyes yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.49,0:42:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲教过我 我能教你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father taught me and I'm gonna teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.04,0:42:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在集中精神 伸出你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to focus and hold out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.96,0:42:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 专心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, good. Now focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.25,0:42:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.22,0:42:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.39,0:42:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好吗 小朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how's it going, kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.85,0:42:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好吗？看看我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How's it going?" Look where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.85,0:42:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们关在钉子做成的笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a cage made of spikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.39,0:42:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, right. Not good. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.23,0:42:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能拿出办法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.40,0:42:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会 但不是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes, I am, but just not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.15,0:42:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个幻影 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the vision ghost. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.57,0:42:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有没有？　- 我们会怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See? - What will happen to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.03,0:42:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁晓得？情况十分不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who can tell? I mean, this is a very, very bad situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.11,0:43:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息是 你们是阿斯加德人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the good news is you're Asgardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.70,0:43:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果死了 你们都会进英灵殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you die, you'll end up in Valhalla.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.91,0:43:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 走开啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.25,0:43:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.50,0:43:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 小朋友 别哭 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. It's all right, children. Don't cry. Don't cry. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.54,0:43:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I've got a plan, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.13,0:43:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会集结一支菁英部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm putting together a really, really good team.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.92,0:43:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有寇格叔叔 瓦尔基丽王\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got Uncle Korg, King Valkyrie…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.64,0:43:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我前女友珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}my ex-girlfriend, Jane,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.08,0:43:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的情史就不说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is a whole other story I won't bore you with, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.35,0:43:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一支顶尖部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is a top-notch team…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.47,0:43:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就带你们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're gonna have you home before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.60,0:43:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.11,0:43:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.32,0:43:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带你们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.78,0:43:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好怕 我们都好怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared. We all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.12,0:43:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔…救救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor! Thor! Save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.04,0:43:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我离开 你们保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here. You take care, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.38,0:43:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们保重 我们很快会见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care. I'll see you soon. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.29,0:43:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾克索 让我离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Axl, get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.09,0:43:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在暗影领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.30,0:44:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.47,0:44:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的浓重大气有种独特的黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heavy atmosphere there has a darkness like no other.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.18,0:44:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,彷佛色彩不敢涉足 很容易辨认\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's as if color fears to tread. It's unmistakable.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.93,0:44:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那如果我们需要色彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then, if it's color we need…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.06,0:44:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就带彩虹过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's bring the rainbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.56,0:44:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,带彩虹过去？这是口号吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Bring the rainbow"? Is that a catchphrase or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.60,0:44:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她刚当雷神没多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's only been a Thor for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.36,0:44:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,救人她很会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, saving lives, she's quite good at.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.84,0:44:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余的有待改进\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the rest of it, she needs work.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.19,0:44:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总共有几个口号？　- 很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many catchphrases have there been? - A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.74,0:44:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我操之过急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Jumped the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.74,0:44:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.13,0:44:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他穿越黑影要去暗影领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}he moves through shadows and he's going to the Shadow Realm…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.91,0:44:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到了那里似乎会威力无穷\N{\fnArial\fs30}it seems like that's where he's going to be the most powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.62,0:44:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 不能冒然前往 可能是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. We can't just go marching in there. It could be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.75,0:44:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会危及小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd be endangering the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.25,0:44:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要援军 必须召集军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need reinforcements. We must raise an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.25,0:44:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想我在想你在想的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you thinking what I think you're thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.67,0:44:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在想　- 我们在想什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm thinking it. - What are we thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.04,0:44:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想什么？　- 我也在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thinking what? - I'm thinking it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.59,0:44:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,全知之城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Omnipotence City.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.17,0:44:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,全知之城是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Omnipotence City?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.76,0:44:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙最强众神的所在地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the home of the most powerful gods in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.09,0:44:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能组成史上最强团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could pull together the greatest team ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.10,0:44:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,召集埃及太阳神、海格力斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could recruit Ra, Hercules…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.43,0:44:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,毛利战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tūmatauenga.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.68,0:44:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,羽蛇神 还有最老最有智慧的宙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quetzalcoatl, maybe. And Zeus, the oldest and wisest of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.52,0:44:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说宙斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you say Zeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.94,0:44:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 宙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.86,0:44:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯 那个宙斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, the Zeus. Zeus-Zeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.44,0:44:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他有没有小名\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure if he has a second name.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.86,0:45:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的神会在那里吗？尼尼诺尼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think my god will be there, Ninny of the Nonny?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.24,0:45:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难说 在的话就请他们加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never know, Korg. But if they are, we'll ask them to join our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.36,0:45:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.36,0:45:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴破坏者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stormbreaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.66,0:45:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 冷静 放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Calm down. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.20,0:45:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不靠风暴破坏者的烂彩虹桥旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, mate, we are not traveling in Stormbreaker's janky Bifrost.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.20,0:45:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看刚刚的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.21,0:45:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能骑你的迷你飞天入口马吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't exactly go in your tiny, little, flying portal horse, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.63,0:45:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,载不下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't all fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.67,0:45:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？战歌超赞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? Warsong's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.13,0:45:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴破坏者也很赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stormbreaker's awesome too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.42,0:45:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴破坏者需要通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stormbreaker just needs a conduit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.88,0:45:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,能进行太空旅行的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything that can handle space travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.47,0:45:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢她聊正事的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love it when she talks shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.84,0:45:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有能力带我们过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has the power to get us there…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.13,0:45:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要有东西集中能量 以免出状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}it just needs something to focus that energy so it's not so unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.93,0:45:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有一艘能驾驭的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if we had a ship we could harness it…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.97,0:45:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可用风暴破坏者当能源\N{\fnArial\fs30}and use Stormbreaker as a power source.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.64,0:45:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像引擎　- 就像引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, like an engine. - Like an engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.48,0:45:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.02,0:45:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.86,0:45:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,把座位全部移走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get rid of all those seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.28,0:45:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把羊绑在前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you guys, go tie those goats to the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.49,0:45:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,15分钟后出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We leave in 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.91,0:45:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,只带必需品 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Essentials only, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.91,0:45:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是必需品\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's essential.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.87,0:45:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,15分钟后启程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen minutes to departure!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.20,0:45:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么快就找到新欢啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you moved on quick, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.67,0:45:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're some piece of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.63,0:46:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨　- 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, hey! - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.67,0:46:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在跟老朋友叙旧　- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just catching up with an old friend. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.38,0:46:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been meaning to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.63,0:46:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我有点怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorta acting a little weird before.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.28,0:46:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道哪根筋不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just haven't really been myself lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.76,0:46:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, kind of…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.39,0:46:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,想搞清楚自己是谁 有点迷惘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to figure out who I am, and just felt a little bit lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.52,0:46:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着突然看到你穿得跟我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, all of a sudden, I see you dressed as me…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.27,0:46:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it was kind of…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.73,0:46:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lot for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.69,0:46:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么凑在一块 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how did you guys get together? How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.15,0:46:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓我听到雷神之锤呼唤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear I heard Mjolnir call to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.36,0:46:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是喔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.03,0:46:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我来这里调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so I came here to investigate…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.87,0:46:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的碎片开始发光 旋转…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and its pieces started glowing and swirling, and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.83,0:46:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.12,0:46:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就成了雷神\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Thor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.87,0:46:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这造型超适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what, it looks good on you, it works, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.09,0:46:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just checking.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.97,0:46:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.30,0:46:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,5分钟后启程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes to departure!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.52,0:46:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.14,0:46:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们聊天而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.70,0:47:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 不要离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.41,0:47:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.58,0:47:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我走了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when I'm gone, honey…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.87,0:47:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.63,0:47:23.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（怀念伊莲佛斯特）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.38,0:47:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whatever happens…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.21,0:47:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不停止奋斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}never stop fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.80,0:47:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不停止奋斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never stop fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.44,0:47:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.53,0:47:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.07,0:47:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗脸盆露馅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sink would say otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.32,0:47:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想我该去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I really should be coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.12,0:47:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身体越来越差\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not getting any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.66,0:47:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是雷神 当然该去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a Thor. Of course, you should come.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.79,0:48:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你还能怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, what else are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.29,0:48:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是维京人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a Viking now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.75,0:48:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说必须战死沙场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means you pretty much have to die in battle…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.04,0:48:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且得痛苦得要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it needs to be devastatingly painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.30,0:48:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你进不了英灵殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, you don't get into Valhalla.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.21,0:48:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这么打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.51,0:48:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当国王的事怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about, you know, kinging and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.93,0:48:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢当国王 我爱我的人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love being king. I love my people…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.68,0:48:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但整天开会 飞鸦传书\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's all meetings and raven-mail…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.22,0:48:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有飞鸦传书就能搞定的会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}and meetings that could've been raven-mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.02,0:48:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想念打仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.35,0:48:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,想念我的姊妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss my sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.60,0:48:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你得去 我需要一个姊妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why you need to come, 'cause I need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.69,0:48:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.98,0:48:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,打包好了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You packed?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.61,0:48:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打包了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you packed?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.49,0:48:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.91,0:48:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,手榴弹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hand grenade?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.12,0:48:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 随身喇叭\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's a portable speaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.46,0:48:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.33,0:48:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗脸盆的事你能保密吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't mind keeping the sink thing under wraps?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.25,0:48:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我罩你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.17,0:48:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的阿斯加德同胞们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fellow Asgardians…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.22,0:48:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿我们旅行快如奥丁渡鸦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish us well, for we shall travel with the speed of Odin's ravens.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.60,0:49:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把孩子们带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will return with children.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.77,0:49:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many children.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.44,0:49:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后设宴庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we shall feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.15,0:49:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吃小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not on the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.94,0:49:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不干那种事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not do that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.86,0:49:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是黑暗的时代 羞耻的时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were dark times. Shameful times.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.15,0:49:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.04,0:50:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在溜直排轮吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you still rollerblading?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.83,0:50:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.75,0:50:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 每个周末\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Every weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.17,0:50:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,溜了就停不下来 对吧 寇格？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you blade, you never fade. Right, Korg?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.21,0:50:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远的直排轮伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skate mates for life!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.29,0:50:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能说一件事吗？　- 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, can I run something by you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.38,0:50:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I was thinking…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.25,0:50:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们找到坏蛋 我想喊个响亮口号\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we get to the bad guy, what about if I had, like, a cool catchphrase?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.63,0:50:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是「吃我的锤子」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, "Eat this hammer!"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.55,0:50:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是「瞧我的大锤」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, like, "Check out my hammer."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.89,0:50:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, what about…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.72,0:50:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我还在发想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No… I'm workshopping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.77,0:50:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都不错 我的口号是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they are all really good. Mine is…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.27,0:50:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「此时此刻做个了断」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This ends here and now."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.19,0:50:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,超赞的口号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's such a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.52,0:50:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我润饰了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took me a long time to perfect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.86,0:50:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的 只要多练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get there. You just need to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.28,0:50:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我第一个坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just my first bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.86,0:50:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个意难忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never forget your first.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.53,0:50:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.16,0:50:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有女朋友吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you got a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.70,0:50:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 太忙了 没空\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Too busy, don't have time, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.21,0:50:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,整天都在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the work and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.25,0:50:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷 我得查看一下这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool. Gonna check this place out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.80,0:50:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}So cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.97,0:50:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么好酷？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's so cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.13,0:51:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些建筑很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}The buildings are cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.14,0:51:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚刚是怎样？　- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happening there? - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.68,0:51:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有粉红泡泡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I sensing feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.77,0:51:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,粉红泡泡？跟珍吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feelings? What, for Jane?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.60,0:51:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't be ridiculous. Feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.23,0:51:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次我们有粉红泡泡是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last time we had feelings were…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.15,0:51:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前 很久很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}long time ago. Long, long gone. I think you…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.90,0:51:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你才有粉红泡泡 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe you have feelings. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.57,0:51:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大哥 放轻松 我们同一国的 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mate, relax. We're on the same team. - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.57,0:51:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们是哪一国的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know exactly what team we're on, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.11,0:51:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱珍国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.79,0:51:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔的优点就是能迅速恢复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing about Thor is that he always bounces back.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.79,0:51:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对　- 海拉偷走他的锤子时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Like when Hela stole his hammer…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.37,0:51:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在垂死星球的核心打造斧头\N{\fnArial\fs30}he went and built an axe which was forged in the heart of a dying star.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.51,0:51:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把斧头砍了萨诺斯的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the same axe was used to cut off Thanos' head.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.22,0:51:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.56,0:51:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好精彩的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a neat story!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.02,0:51:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,聊了这么多砍头的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all this talk about chopping off heads…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.11,0:51:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,害我手都痒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna have a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.27,0:51:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.61,0:52:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是阿弟 你好 阿弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Octy. Hello, Octy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.49,0:52:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.45,0:52:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道阿弟喜欢什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what Octy loves?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.87,0:52:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它的头被扯断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having his head ripped off!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.92,0:52:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们刚刚还很喜欢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You liked it a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.71,0:52:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.34,0:52:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿弟走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Octy's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.30,0:52:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.18,0:52:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.97,0:52:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.39,0:52:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识一个跟你一样的小女生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew a little girl just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.90,0:52:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很勇敢 很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she was brave, and she was smart…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.28,0:52:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,又好玩 喜欢画画\N{\fnArial\fs30}and funny and she liked to draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.49,0:52:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你们一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you a question…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.83,0:52:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟神有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}about gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.62,0:52:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,祂们应该保护你们 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're meant to protect you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.33,0:52:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那祂们在哪呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.83,0:52:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 索尔就快来了　- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thor is on his way. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.71,0:53:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I'm counting on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.01,0:53:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们才在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.64,0:53:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,限受邀者参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's invitation only,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.74,0:53:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们低调混进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we're gonna have to keep a low profile and blend in.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.60,0:53:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好伪装是我的强项\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luckily, disguises are my specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.94,0:53:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,希腊哲学家？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greek philosopher?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.56,0:53:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弄来这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got us these.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.19,0:53:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.36,0:53:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的伪装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actual disguises.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.15,0:53:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是情感众神的披风\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the cloaks of the emotion gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.61,0:53:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个颜色象征不同情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every color signifies a different emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.62,0:53:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,情感众神在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the emotion gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.28,0:53:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.91,0:53:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.22,0:53:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎莅临黄金神殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Golden Temple, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.30,0:53:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是宇宙最强造物神祇聚会的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where the most powerful creator gods in the universe hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.43,0:53:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有魔力之神、梦之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the god of magic, the god of dreams…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.44,0:53:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,木工之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}the god of carpentry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.81,0:53:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.06,0:53:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是包子 饺子之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. That's Bao, god of dumplings.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.11,0:54:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 包子　- 包子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Bao! - Bao.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.98,0:54:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look up there, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.15,0:54:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是克罗南的神 尼尼诺尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the Kronan god, Ninny of the Nonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.61,0:54:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 尼尼诺尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ninny Nonny!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.58,0:54:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus! Zeus! Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.54,0:54:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus! Zeus! Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.82,0:54:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.16,0:54:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是宙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.12,0:54:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.50,0:55:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟人 神话 传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man, the myth, the legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.88,0:55:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不晓得你知不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you know this…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.96,0:55:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很多地方都效法这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I base a lot of what I do on this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.21,0:55:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是闪电之神 我是雷霆之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the god of lightning, I'm the god of thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.01,0:55:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给了我不少灵感　- 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huge source of inspiration. - That's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.22,0:55:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请他支持军队时应该先提这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should lead with that when you ask him for an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.80,0:55:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么上去？用飞的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get up there? Do we just, like, fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.47,0:55:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能在进场时打扰他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we can't interrupt him in the middle of an entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.98,0:55:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以进场浮夸出名的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's famous for his entrances.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.77,0:55:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷霆闪电…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thunderbolt! Thunderbolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.19,0:55:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.90,0:55:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.58,0:55:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,赞！雷霆闪电！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Thunderbolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.46,0:55:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.05,0:55:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.01,0:55:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静！安静！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silence! Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.68,0:55:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我特此召开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hereby open…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.18,0:56:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这神圣的神祇大会\N{\fnArial\fs30}this holy council of the god.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.98,0:56:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有许多严肃的议题要讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where we have many, many serious matter to be talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.82,0:56:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,例如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such as…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.82,0:56:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年的群交趴在哪里举行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}where are we going to hold this year's orgy?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.74,0:56:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是认真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this guy for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.20,0:56:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点想吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I'm not mad at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.53,0:56:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他有他的道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sure he has a point, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.70,0:56:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.87,0:56:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now we're going to announce the winner…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.21,0:56:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,「以上帝之名牺牲最多人」的优胜者\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the, "Most human souls sacrificed in the name of a god."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.63,0:56:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他没那么棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, maybe he's not that great.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.13,0:56:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.63,0:56:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想再糟就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think it's gonna get any better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.51,0:56:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些神帮不上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, these gods aren't gonna help.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.09,0:56:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那个雷霆闪电可能用得上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that thunderbolt, I think that might be of use.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.72,0:56:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍 你往右 索尔 你往左\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, you go right. Thor, you go left.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.81,0:56:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出其不备 抢走闪电\N{\fnArial\fs30}We bum-rush him, take the bolt, ding-dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.39,0:56:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们去抢　- 不…等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, let's go get it! - No, no, no, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.64,0:56:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能用突袭的阴招\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no ding-donging or bum-rushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.48,0:56:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是对宙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially not Zeus' bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.11,0:56:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找个适当时机跟他谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the time is right, I'm gonna talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.77,0:56:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time is right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.77,0:56:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time is not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.86,0:56:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.32,0:56:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.53,0:56:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这几个　- 寇格 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These guys. - Korg, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.99,0:56:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有话对大家说吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have something to say to the group?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.78,0:56:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.95,0:56:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我60秒后开扁 快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm bashing heads in 60 seconds, so speak fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.83,0:57:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人得受点教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Literally, heads will roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.08,0:57:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们吃错药啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.25,0:57:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.83,0:57:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想先说非常荣幸能够…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me be the first to say it is an honor and a privilege to be…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.50,0:57:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.84,0:57:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你上台吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take the stage?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.63,0:57:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面的舞台？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stage down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.38,0:57:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你看很像舞台的那个区域？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yes. You see the area that looks very much like a stage?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.18,0:57:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.40,0:57:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.57,0:57:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.98,0:57:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.83,0:57:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,强大的宙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mighty Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.79,0:57:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.37,0:57:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙众神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gods of the universe…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.46,0:57:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来求助 希望召集大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come here to ask for your help, to raise an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.00,0:57:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个叫屠神者的疯子想杀光我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a maniac called the God Butcher who seeks to end us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.17,0:57:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到处烧杀掳掠\N{\fnArial\fs30}His destruction is everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.84,0:57:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,众多星球、领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Entire planets, realms…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.01,0:57:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,都已陷入浩劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been left completely unprotected.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.64,0:57:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他造成灾难与混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's left nothing but chaos in his wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.18,0:58:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道他的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know where he is…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.89,0:58:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有各位的协助 我们能及早击溃他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with your help we can crush him before he kills anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.56,0:58:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.02,0:58:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了几个低阶的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}he killed a couple of low-level god.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.23,0:58:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜呼哀哉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boo-hoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.40,0:58:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你讲完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's all…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.90,0:58:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鲜肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretty boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.20,0:58:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就回座乖乖闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}you go back to your seat and you be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.11,0:58:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你没听到我说的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sorry. Did you not hear any of what I just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.70,0:58:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大开杀戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's murdering en masse.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.41,0:58:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you one time…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.66,0:58:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}now, you shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.83,0:58:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静惦惦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.00,0:58:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就快无法受邀参加群交趴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you are this close to being uninvited to the orgy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.79,0:58:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯 我们必须采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus, we must do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.25,0:58:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不准参加群交趴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot come to the orgy!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.21,0:58:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得听我们的　- 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have to listen to us! - That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.63,0:58:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,上铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shackle!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.22,0:58:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下 你准备好就告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Highness, whenever you're ready, you just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.93,0:58:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听我的指示　- 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We go on my signal. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.27,0:58:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么指示？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.43,0:58:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会说「上」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be, "Go."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.60,0:58:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看看你是何方神圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.06,0:58:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要卸下你的伪装\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take off your disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.82,0:58:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹指神功！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And flick!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.91,0:59:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弹太大力了 可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You flicked too hard, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.79,0:59:06.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（洛基安息）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.16,0:59:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该帮他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.58,0:59:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后还是要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.08,0:59:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃葡萄？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grape?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.29,0:59:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像软趴趴的小胡瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a shy courgette.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.13,0:59:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外那几个呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.05,0:59:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们的伪装也卸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take off their disguise too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.34,0:59:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别弹我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. No. Don't flick us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.72,0:59:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.47,0:59:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,伪装没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disguise gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.43,0:59:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disguise off. Cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.47,0:59:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.18,0:59:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为奥丁死后就不会见到你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we'd seen the last of you when Odin died.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.23,0:59:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Thor…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.90,0:59:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷霆之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}the God of Thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.23,0:59:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷霆不就是闪电的声音吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But is not thunder just the sound of lightning?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.78,0:59:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,酸得好 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good one, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.15,0:59:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯 此事无关我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus, this is bigger than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.53,0:59:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带走阿斯加德小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taken Asgardian children.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.74,0:59:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我们是谁？神界警察？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think we are? The god police?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.83,0:59:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个神都看顾着自己的子民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every god watches over their own peoples.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.29,0:59:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不多不少 如此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing more, nothing less.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.00,0:59:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德人的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgardian problems…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.59,0:59:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是阿斯加德人的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}are Asgardian problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.38,1:00:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,强者竟堕落至此\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the mighty have fallen.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.55,1:00:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的英雄宙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hero, Zeus…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.89,1:00:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓到皮皮剉\N{\fnArial\fs30}afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.15,1:00:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有几点要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.11,1:00:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 没错 我会怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, yes, I am scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.66,1:00:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,格尔有死灵剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gorr has the Necrosword…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.16,1:00:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有办法杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means he could kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.83,1:00:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不妙 第二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good. Two…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.37,1:00:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想做对的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're trying to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.46,1:00:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.79,1:00:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你只会引起恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}But all you do is cause a panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.42,1:00:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐慌不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Panic is not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.29,1:00:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are safe here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.96,1:00:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 朋友 你在这里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, my friend. You are safe here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.88,1:00:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以安啦 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, chill, baby cake.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.01,1:00:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝点酒 吃点葡萄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have some wine, have some grape.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.43,1:00:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在全知之城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything goes here…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.06,1:00:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,无拘无束\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Omnipotence City.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.06,1:00:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三 别跟宙斯顶嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, don't talk back to Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.89,1:00:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弹太大力了 帮你把衣服穿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I flicked too hard. I put your clothes back on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.77,1:00:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我把你衣服穿回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I put your clothes back on!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.40,1:00:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹 弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flick, flick.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.36,1:01:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是众神的黄金神殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this is the Golden Temple of the god.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.61,1:01:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是脱光光嘉年华\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a rudie-nudie festival.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.24,1:01:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不帮忙 至少让我们用你的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're not gonna help us, then at least let us use your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.99,1:01:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你的闪电\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your lightning bolt.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.08,1:01:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的闪电叫雷霆闪电\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lightning bolt is called Thunderbolt.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.50,1:01:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要用别人的秘密武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I think to use somebody's secret weapon like this…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.88,1:01:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少该把名字说对\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you should at least get the name right when you ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.05,1:01:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能借用雷霆闪电吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I borrow Thunderbolt?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.92,1:01:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷霆闪电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thunderbolt!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.53,1:01:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不借\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.16,1:01:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.54,1:01:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠神者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The God Butcher…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.88,1:02:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到不了永恒\N{\fnArial\fs30}he will not reach Eternity.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.17,1:02:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,永恒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eternity?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.38,1:02:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,到不了永恒是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he mean, reach Eternity?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.51,1:02:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.85,1:02:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,永恒是宇宙中心的强大存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eternity is a very powerful being at the center of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.10,1:02:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会让率先到达的人实现愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will grant the desire of the first person who reaches it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.23,1:02:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像许愿池？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it's like a wishing well?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.57,1:02:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想叫屠神者的人有什么愿望？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think a guy called the God Butcher would wish for?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.49,1:02:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他想找永恒祭坛 代表他能一举歼灭我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he seeks the Altar of Eternity, that means he could wipe us out at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.58,1:02:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯 我们必须立刻采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus, we must act now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.33,1:02:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not going to make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.25,1:02:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't have the key.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.12,1:02:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是众神的使命吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this the purpose of the gods?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.04,1:02:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,像懦夫一样躲在黄金宫殿里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To hide away in a golden palace like cowards?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.88,1:02:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们失去了方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we have lost our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.92,1:02:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们自己去阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? We'll stop him ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.09,1:02:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕不能同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am afraid I cannot allow that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.63,1:02:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个秘密之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a secret place…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.14,1:02:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有众神知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}known only to the gods.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.31,1:02:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.18,1:02:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠神者可能利用你找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The God Butcher could use you to find us.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.56,1:02:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.06,1:03:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.32,1:03:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.19,1:03:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.86,1:03:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.03,1:03:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,能执行我的计划了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we do my plan now?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.12,1:03:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 痛扁他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Rush his bum.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.12,1:03:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,赞啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.21,1:03:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没说「上」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't say, "Go."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.21,1:03:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming, guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.77,1:03:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔 接住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor, catch!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.94,1:03:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,寇格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Korg!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.42,1:04:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦尔 蹲低\N{\fnArial\fs30}Val, duck!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.01,1:04:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,寇格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Korg!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.22,1:04:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.80,1:04:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…寇格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. No. Korg!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.47,1:04:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔 我快挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor, I'm perishing!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.73,1:04:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.94,1:04:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是下一个 奥汀森\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're next, Odinson!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.20,1:04:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是闪电的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the sound of lightning.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.63,1:04:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.55,1:04:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,寇格…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Korgi. Korgi!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.71,1:04:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.88,1:04:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 寇格？　- 我在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Korgi? - I'm down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.38,1:04:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里？我救你出来 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where? Where are you? I'm gonna get you out. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.89,1:04:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 寇格　- 在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Korg. Korgi! - Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.26,1:04:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't die!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.39,1:04:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 对 你活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Yes! You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.64,1:05:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果克罗南人只有嘴巴是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out the only part of a Kronan that's alive is his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.64,1:05:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,寇格 你快召唤羊儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Korgi, listen. I need you to call the goats.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.77,1:05:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.86,1:05:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的生命守护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guard him with your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.36,1:05:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.36,1:05:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备去兜风了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to go for a ride?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.70,1:05:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我注意背后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you've got my six.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.49,1:05:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,8点钟方向 瓦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight o'clock, Val.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.58,1:05:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,7点48分\N{\fnArial\fs30}7:48.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.04,1:05:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.12,1:05:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not it. No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.62,1:05:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.83,1:05:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,寇格 嘴噘起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Korg, purse those lips.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.97,1:05:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.39,1:06:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,羊船过来救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the goat boat came in, rescued us…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.22,1:06:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们破窗而出 结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we flew out the window. The end.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.85,1:06:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是一场经典的索尔冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another classic Thor adventure.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.02,1:06:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟然杀了宙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you killed Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.77,1:06:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,俗话说 千万别跟你的英雄见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what they say, never meet your heroes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.40,1:06:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是我们就要去救你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what's important is we are on our way to you right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.15,1:06:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you guys doing? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.95,1:06:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没事 有点害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all right. A little scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.70,1:06:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道害怕的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, listen, I know what it's like to be scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.95,1:06:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你们 我在你们这年纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll tell you, when I was your age…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.70,1:06:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不像你们这么勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I would have been as brave as you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.50,1:06:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.66,1:06:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是我见过最勇敢的阿斯加德人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, might just be the bravest Asgardians that I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.67,1:06:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.96,1:06:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们继续勇敢下去 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I need you to keep being brave, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.05,1:06:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,互相照顾 你们是一个团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}And take care of each other. You're a team now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.38,1:06:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,笼中小鬼队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team Kids in a Cage.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.43,1:06:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们做得到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.09,1:07:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 我们做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I think we can do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.97,1:07:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.48,1:07:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.94,1:07:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 索尔？　- 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thor? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.56,1:07:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴见到我的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad I met my hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.11,1:07:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 小老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thanks, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.70,1:07:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are the children?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.18,1:07:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点害怕 毕竟是孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can imagine, they're a little bit scared because they're kids…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.32,1:07:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我说一切都会照计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I told them that everything is going to plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.12,1:07:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗他们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so you lied to them?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.20,1:07:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有计划吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.29,1:07:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有计划　- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, there's a plan. - There's no plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.45,1:07:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有计划　- 没有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There is a plan. - No. There's no plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.75,1:07:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法召集一支军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}We failed to raise a god army…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.96,1:07:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,寇格死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Korg is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.13,1:07:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他没死　- 我没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's not dead. - I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.38,1:07:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一颗头 而你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's a head. And you…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.00,1:07:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你丢脸丢到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got properly humiliated.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.55,1:07:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是脱光光 无所谓啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I got properly naked, which I am okay with.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.01,1:07:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珍？　- 我无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jane? - I was okay with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.76,1:07:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 寇格　- 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Korg? - I loved it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.05,1:07:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是我们要进入暗影领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is, we are going into the Shadow Realm…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.01,1:07:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,实力却比以前弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}weaker than we were before.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.47,1:07:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.93,1:07:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人会死　- 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No one's gonna die, okay? - Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.56,1:07:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,安啦 我们在那里表现超杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is fine. We did great back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.98,1:07:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们杀了宙斯　- 你杀了宙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We killed Zeus! - You killed Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.06,1:07:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对全宇宙不见得是场灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that may or may not be catastrophic for the whole universe…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.15,1:07:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 整个神王国大概会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, sure, the entire god kingdom is probably going…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.19,1:07:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辈子追杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hunt us down for the rest of our days…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.74,1:08:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你抢走这件漂亮的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}but listen, you stole this beautiful weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.41,1:08:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,它等于一支军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? This is the army right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.45,1:08:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,光滑细长 威力强大 美丽耀眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sleek, it's slender, it's powerful, it's beautiful…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.54,1:08:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 我想给你用 瓦尔基丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you. I love it for you, Valkyrie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.54,1:08:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是很爱啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's not really what I'm into…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.21,1:08:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有自己的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I've got my weapon out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.25,1:08:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,借用一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I borrow that for a second?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.88,1:08:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里 老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.59,1:08:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时进场的气势不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was quite an entrance back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.77,1:08:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.44,1:08:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}are we good?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.77,1:08:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.94,1:08:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道前武器待在身边是有点怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I know it's a little weird having my ex-weapon around…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.07,1:08:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是雷神之锤是过去式了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but come on, Mjolnir, in the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.32,1:08:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you and me now, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.82,1:08:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.49,1:08:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该喝第一杯啤酒了 怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time for your first beer. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.62,1:08:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.71,1:08:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我们最近吵架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry we've been fighting lately.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.43,1:09:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.84,1:09:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.60,1:09:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,景色很棒吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quite the view, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.02,1:09:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.19,1:09:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说你在那里的表现很了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to say that was very, very impressive what you did back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.56,1:09:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和雷神之锤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Mjolnir, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.03,1:09:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.66,1:09:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太空海豚　- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Space dolphins. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.37,1:09:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该看看太空海豚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should see some space dolphins…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.99,1:09:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.58,1:09:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇　- 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.25,1:09:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好美啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.67,1:09:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好美 好罕见\N{\fnArial\fs30}So beautiful. So rare.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.29,1:09:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常忠心的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very loyal creatures.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.50,1:09:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会在一起一辈子 六只一组\N{\fnArial\fs30}They mate for life, in packs of six.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.42,1:09:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为了爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just love.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.34,1:09:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑的尼尼诺尼 白的分尼风尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a hey ninny-nonny and a fair finny-fonny.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.39,1:09:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你看起来好辣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, brother man, you look so hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.89,1:09:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想伸进你的岩石缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna get in your rocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.43,1:09:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们凑在一起 天雷勾动地火\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we get together We're gonna get it on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.44,1:09:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会制造一些宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're all gonna make some babies.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.98,1:10:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我爸在追\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the song that my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.14,1:10:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我另一个爸爸时唱的歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}sang to my other dad when they were courting.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.03,1:10:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个克罗南人\N{\fnArial\fs30}When two Kronans wanna make a baby,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.41,1:10:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,想生孩子就到山上\N{\fnArial\fs30}they get together inside a mountain…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.12,1:10:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,找一座小熔岩池\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they go down to a little lava pool,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.12,1:10:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在熔岩上方牵手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they hold hands over the hot lava…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.74,1:10:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过一个月 他们的手分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then, after a month, they pull their hands apart…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.16,1:10:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会创造一个漂亮的克罗南小男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they find they've created a beautiful new Kronan baby boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.67,1:10:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思 好火辣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating. And hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.79,1:10:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有过心上人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever have a special someone?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.17,1:10:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有过好多心上人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had so many special someones.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.13,1:10:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 不晓得\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't know…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.51,1:10:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道还要不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I want that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.80,1:10:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你在战争中失去女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that because you lost your girlfriend in battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.70,1:10:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法原谅自己？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and never forgave yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.60,1:10:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你想靠喝酒或打炮找答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, you're just trying to find answers in the bottom of a bottle…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.35,1:10:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,却只能麻痹痛苦的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}or some meaningless dalliance, which only serves to numb the pain…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.35,1:10:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法带来真正的幸福或满足？\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of bringing you real happiness or satisfaction?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.15,1:10:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 差不多是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.28,1:10:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好美 好美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful. Beautiful things.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.45,1:10:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.91,1:10:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.08,1:10:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想对你感到糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna feel shitty about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.50,1:10:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.59,1:11:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想有糟糕的感觉 对象是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna feel shitty about something and I think that's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.38,1:11:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有听没有懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really getting any better.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.63,1:11:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not, is it? Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.72,1:11:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友说失去爱之后感觉糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend, he told me that it's better to feel shitty…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.64,1:11:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,比从来没经历爱情\N{\fnArial\fs30}from losing love than it is to never experience love…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.72,1:11:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没感觉 感到空虚来得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to feel nothing at all, to feel empty…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.31,1:11:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think he was right…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.27,1:11:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正是我长久以来的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is how I've been feeling for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.86,1:11:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把别人推开 跟他们保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've pushed people away, kept them at a distance…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.32,1:11:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为害怕失去\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of the fear of that loss…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.78,1:11:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不想那样了 不要那种生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't wanna do that anymore. I don't wanna live like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.99,1:11:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,封闭心房比感到痛苦好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better to close off your heart than feel the pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.78,1:11:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是那样 我封闭了心房\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I did, yes. I closed off my heart…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.20,1:11:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始冥想 你有冥想吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I meditated. Did you meditate?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.08,1:11:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 那好无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's so boring.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.41,1:11:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它让我更愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It actually made me more angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.04,1:11:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再把自己交给命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm tired of giving myself over to the idea of fate…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.75,1:11:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想搞懂宇宙要我怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and trying to figure out what the universe wants from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.21,1:11:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想活在当下 彷佛没有明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna live in the moment, I wanna live like there's no tomorrow…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.84,1:11:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再诚惶诚恐过日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}throw caution to the wind.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.09,1:11:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟你在一起 珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna be with you, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.01,1:11:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.68,1:11:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得了癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have cancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.76,1:11:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.39,1:11:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.56,1:11:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事？　- 掰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. What's happening? - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.94,1:12:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…珍…等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Jane, Jane, Jane. Wait, wait, wait. Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.44,1:12:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了什么？我开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I say? I didn't mean that. Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.57,1:12:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才没得癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have cancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.28,1:12:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去惩奸除恶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go smash something.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.49,1:12:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍 我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.66,1:12:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别替我遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be sorry for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.20,1:12:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,何时发现的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.91,1:12:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.87,1:12:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是疲倦 他们就说我第四期\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just feeling tired, and then they told me I have Stage Four.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.84,1:12:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我安排后事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get my affairs in order.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.38,1:12:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着我听到雷神之锤呼唤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I heard Mjolnir calling me…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.51,1:12:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想如果科学没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I thought maybe, if science isn't working…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.89,1:12:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许维京人的太空魔力可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe Viking space magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.35,1:12:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你来到新阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you came to New Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.02,1:12:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我想锤子或许能治愈我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I thought the hammer maybe could cure me…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.02,1:12:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想病情好转了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think it's getting better.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.61,1:12:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.11,1:12:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍 我们都不知道能活多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, none of us know how long we have.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.49,1:12:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道明天会如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what tomorrow holds.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.91,1:12:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷神之锤\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mjolnir…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.28,1:12:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷神之锤选择了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mjolnir chose you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.41,1:12:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it chose you because you're worthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.49,1:12:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's something.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.91,1:13:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚认识你时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I first met you…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.71,1:13:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不值得 无法举起那把锤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was unworthy. I was unable to pick up that hammer.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.21,1:13:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你教我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you taught me…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.54,1:13:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,最崇高的使命莫过于帮助受难的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is no greater purpose than to help those in need.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.26,1:13:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我有了价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made me worthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.80,1:13:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你想怎么做 我们都能一起行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever you wanna do, we can do together.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.14,1:13:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.31,1:13:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what do you wanna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.18,1:13:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想带那些孩子回到家人身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna get those children back to their families.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.02,1:13:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想完成那项任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna finish that mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.48,1:13:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然是雷神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoken like a true Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.69,1:13:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有什么感觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel now?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.24,1:13:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}So scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.66,1:13:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的感觉呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.82,1:13:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.20,1:13:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,多糟糕？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How shitty?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.24,1:13:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的超糟糕　- 那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really shitty. - Well, then…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.01,1:13:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道他们俩在聊什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what those two are talking about out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.68,1:13:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是在聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they're not talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.47,1:14:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想他们会不会在热熔岩池上牵手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think those two will ever hold hands over a hot lava pool.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.58,1:14:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造雷神宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make a Thor baby?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.77,1:14:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜不太可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unlikely, sadly.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.52,1:14:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可惜了 索尔会是个好爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's too bad. I think Thor would make a great dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.44,1:14:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. We're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.83,1:14:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,色彩都到哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did all the color go?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.86,1:15:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.62,1:15:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.89,1:15:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.01,1:15:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,彩虹桥是钥匙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bifrost is the key?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.39,1:16:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.08,1:16:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛把风暴破坏者丢出窗外？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna tell me why you just threw Stormbreaker out the window?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.66,1:16:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得用它来打开永恒之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs it to open the Gates of Eternity.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.11,1:17:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能老是这样见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really have to stop meeting like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.74,1:17:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤斧头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call the axe.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.95,1:17:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你召唤牙医我就召唤斧头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call the axe when you call the dentist.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.62,1:17:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤斧头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call the axe.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.41,1:17:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我孩子在哪 不然我杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where the children are or I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.59,1:17:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤斧头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call the axe.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.22,1:17:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样也算神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some god you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.93,1:17:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不懂怎么当神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know nothing of being a god.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.86,1:17:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你向众神求助 祂们袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went to the gods for help, and they did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.53,1:17:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在那方面半斤八两\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're alike in that sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.78,1:17:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟你完全不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's nothing like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.24,1:17:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.91,1:17:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说他跟你完全不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said he's nothing like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.87,1:17:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.41,1:17:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是伪君子 我其实是在创造和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a hypocrite. I'm truly creating peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.96,1:17:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,和平？你残杀无辜的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace? You're murdering innocent gods.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.88,1:18:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,无辜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Innocent?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.09,1:18:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是瓦尔基丽吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a Valkyrie?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.26,1:18:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.43,1:18:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让人兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}How exciting!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.01,1:18:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,众神也让你失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the gods failed you, too…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.35,1:18:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你们姊妹淘无意中引起大屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}when your sisterhood was led to slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.23,1:18:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不准说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you dare speak…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.10,1:18:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有向神祈祷吗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you pray to the gods…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.32,1:18:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你爱的女人在战场上奄奄一息？\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the women you loved laid dying on the battlefield?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.45,1:18:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你的家人惨遭杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you beg them for help…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.24,1:18:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有乞求祂们帮忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}as your family was massacred?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.25,1:18:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,聊得真开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good chat.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.00,1:18:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.67,1:18:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.55,1:18:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're different.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.80,1:18:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.35,1:18:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.44,1:18:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.77,1:19:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们同病相怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the same path.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.94,1:19:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同死灵剑赋予我力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as the sword empowered me…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.95,1:19:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那锤子也给了你力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}the hammer empowered you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.03,1:19:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它没有改变你的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it did nothing to change your fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.75,1:19:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,众神会利用你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods will use you…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.75,1:19:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不会救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they will not help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.92,1:19:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得不到永恒的恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no eternal reward for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.68,1:19:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就快走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be gone soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.98,1:19:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道谁不会救她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know who won't help her?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.85,1:19:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你猜一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you one guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.82,1:19:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know your pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.37,1:19:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱就是痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love is pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.00,1:20:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经有个女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a daughter once.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.25,1:20:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信一个更高的神灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put my faith in a higher power…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.38,1:20:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望祂会救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}hoping it would save her…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.26,1:20:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.14,1:20:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,却死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}died.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.89,1:20:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.14,1:20:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿算好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter is the lucky one.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.02,1:20:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不必在一个充满苦难的世界…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She does not have to grow up in a world of suffering…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.40,1:20:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}and pain…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.07,1:20:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶众神掌控的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}run by wicked gods.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.99,1:20:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choose love.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.50,1:20:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤斧头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call the axe.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.63,1:20:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.09,1:20:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,斧头\N{\fnArial\fs30}the axe.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.76,1:21:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.17,1:21:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.22,1:21:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna kill this guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.43,1:21:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 但得活捉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do I, but we have to take him alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.06,1:21:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是找到那些孩子的唯一线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's our only link to finding those children.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.01,1:22:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 羊先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mr. Goat.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.58,1:23:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Val!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.72,1:23:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得带她离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get her out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.90,1:23:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.29,1:24:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了 快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, we're here. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.37,1:24:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴破坏者 带我们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stormbreaker, take us home.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.89,1:25:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,扩散速度前所未见\N{\fnArial\fs30}…at a rate that none of us have seen before.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.31,1:25:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能尝试更积极的疗法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there are other more aggressive forms of treatment we can try…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.64,1:25:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她身体的抗癌能力受到影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}but something's affecting her body's ability to fight the cancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.73,1:25:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.37,1:25:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.17,1:25:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's goin' on out there?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.37,1:25:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有白痴做了一台没门的冰箱 超扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some moron made a fridge without a door. Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.42,1:25:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我把它打开 拿了各种好料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to worry. Got it open and got you all sorts of goodies.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.63,1:25:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦尔还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Val?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.97,1:25:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很痛苦 但情况稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in a lot of pain, but she is stable.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.47,1:25:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.84,1:25:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把这个拿掉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you just gotta get this out of my…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.39,1:25:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 插着别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. That's gotta stay in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.02,1:25:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,神药正在发挥作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all the magic potions and elixirs doing their thing, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.85,1:25:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出去一下 救回孩子 干掉那坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna pop out for a moment, pick up the kids, kill the bad guy…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.77,1:25:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'll come straight back.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.11,1:26:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不找我去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going without me?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.44,1:26:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.61,1:26:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说什么都要一起做吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to, like, doing everything together?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.74,1:26:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会利用孩子分散你注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna use those kids to distract you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.82,1:26:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.08,1:26:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是需要你 需要你活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do need you, Jane. I need you alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.45,1:26:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在战场上并肩对抗格尔固然很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be great to have you on the battlefield, fighting Gorr side by side…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.62,1:26:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那锤子会害死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that hammer is killing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.75,1:26:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次使用 你就耗尽力气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time you use it, it's draining all of your mortal strength…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.92,1:26:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,导致你的身体无力抗癌\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving your body unable to fight the cancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.88,1:26:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是要活得彷佛没有明天吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to, "Live like there's no tomorrow"?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.97,1:26:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我不知道你可能没有明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's before I knew you might not have one.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.01,1:26:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那何不再进行一次冒险？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not have one more adventure?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.60,1:26:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍 有活命的机会就得把握\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, if there's a chance to live, you have to take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.89,1:26:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没罹癌的雷神只会出一张嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoken like a true Thor who does not have cancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.23,1:26:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是新墨西哥来的冷静天体物理学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I seem like some cool astrophysicist from New Mexico…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.36,1:26:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,美梦都成真了 但看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}just living the dream, but look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.11,1:26:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要继续奋战 我是女雷神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna keep fighting. I'm the Mighty Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.95,1:26:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却要阻止我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want me not to do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.32,1:26:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续治疗有什么意义？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point of more time of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.95,1:26:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.04,1:26:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直爱着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always loved you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.84,1:27:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们在一起的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is a chance for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.59,1:27:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你再举起那把锤子 机会就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you pick up that damn hammer again, then that chance is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.19,1:27:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己决定 珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your choice, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.77,1:27:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会后悔一辈子 如果没求你留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'd regret it every single day if I didn't ask you to stay here…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.69,1:27:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我们一起设法解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we could try and figure this out together.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.78,1:27:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好回来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better come back to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.62,1:27:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽快赶回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming back as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.12,1:27:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运　- 我会打断他的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Break a leg. - I'll break all his legs.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.14,1:27:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了永恒之门位于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that the Gate to Eternity is at the literal center…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.43,1:27:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宇宙中心 - 宇宙嘛 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- of the universe. - Universe. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.64,1:27:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果经过彗星群…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you go past the cluster of comets…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.06,1:27:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们谈过 我不会迷路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, I know. We've been over this. I'm not gonna get lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.81,1:28:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伤口感觉怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how you feeling with the old stab wound?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.40,1:28:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的肾脏好像没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I lost my kidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.73,1:28:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone completely?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.15,1:28:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想陪你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could join you…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.44,1:28:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我大概会死 那样没帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'd probably die, and that won't help get the kids back…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.07,1:28:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you'll have to go alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.11,1:28:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要摧毁那把剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is destroy that sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.83,1:28:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他力量的来源 没了他就撑不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his source of power. He won't survive long without it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.46,1:28:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 不要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Don't die.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.79,1:28:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.72,1:29:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,永恒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eternity.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.02,1:29:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.20,1:29:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.31,1:30:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.86,1:30:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道他会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew he'd come.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.94,1:30:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.11,1:30:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, kids!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.20,1:30:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家没事吧？靠过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone okay? All right, gather round. Gather round.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.41,1:30:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好高兴见到你本人 好开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you in person, buddy. Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.05,1:30:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 以下是我们的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen up. Here's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.55,1:30:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们偷偷溜到风暴破坏者那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna sneak our way towards Stormbreaker…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.85,1:30:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心别碰上那些黑影大怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}being very careful not to bump into any of those big shadow monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.31,1:30:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就在我背后吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're behind me, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.40,1:30:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁打过仗吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anyone here have battle experience?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.11,1:30:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,打过仗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Battle experience?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.24,1:30:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,择期不如撞日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no time to learn like the present.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.37,1:31:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不像你这么壮 我们是小孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not strong like you. We're just kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.95,1:31:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了你们是阿斯加德小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't forget you're Asgardian kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.37,1:31:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是 我是狼人小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not. I'm just a Lycan kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.25,1:31:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迈达斯人小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm a Midassian kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.54,1:31:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是法利加人　- 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Falligarian. - Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.83,1:31:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今天你们是阿斯加德人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But today you're Asgardians.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.46,1:31:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在拿起武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now collect your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.88,1:31:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.92,1:31:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找任何能用的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and find anything you can pick up.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.09,1:31:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.51,1:31:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.43,1:31:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, cool. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.80,1:31:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们越来越靠近 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting closer. Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.60,1:31:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.23,1:31:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们将名留青史\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today is a day that will go down in history.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.77,1:31:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天将是后代不会遗忘的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today is the day they will talk about for generations to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.15,1:31:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们是太空维京人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today we are Space Vikings!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.40,1:31:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起武器 敬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Present arms!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.58,1:31:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人拿起这些武器 有信心能返家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whosoever holds these weapons, and believes in getting home…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.45,1:31:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要秉持忠心 就值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they be true of heart is therefore worthy…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.46,1:31:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,将拥有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and shall possess…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.92,1:31:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有时限…\N{\fnArial\fs30}for limited time only…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.05,1:31:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷神索尔的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}the power of Thor!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.98,1:32:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾克索将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Axl…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.94,1:32:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,带领你的军队到斧头那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}lead your army to that axe.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.44,1:32:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会全力以赴\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall do our worst.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.40,1:32:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.98,1:34:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,赞啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.60,1:34:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.95,1:34:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.39,1:34:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁那把剑 他就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We destroy that sword and he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.14,1:34:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,入口快开了 你得阻止风暴破坏者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gateway's almost open. You gotta stop Stormbreaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.98,1:34:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.36,1:35:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴破坏者 快停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stormbreaker, stop this!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.61,1:35:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,清醒一点 瞧你干的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a hold of yourself. Look what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.41,1:35:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你拔起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.70,1:35:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.25,1:35:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.80,1:35:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输了 索尔女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've lost, Lady Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.77,1:35:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}First off…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.14,1:35:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫女雷神\N{\fnArial\fs30}the name is Mighty Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.36,1:35:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二\N{\fnArial\fs30}And secondly…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.81,1:35:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不会说女雷神\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you can't say Mighty Thor…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.82,1:35:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能接受珍佛斯特博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll accept Doctor Jane Foster.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.41,1:35:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thirdly…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.33,1:35:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃我的锤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat my hammer!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.51,1:36:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴破坏者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stormbreaker!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.18,1:36:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.56,1:36:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾克索 带他们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Axl! Get them home!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.54,1:38:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.17,1:38:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.54,1:38:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.12,1:38:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,格尔 停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gorr! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.17,1:38:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果停止 我算…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of father would I be…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.88,1:38:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪门子父亲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I stopped?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.38,1:38:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解你的痛苦 但这不是办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know your pain, but this isn't the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.55,1:39:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你寻求的不是死亡或复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not death or revenge that you seek.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.23,1:39:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我寻求的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I seek?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.03,1:39:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你寻求的是爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seek love.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.66,1:39:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.00,1:39:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为何要寻求爱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I seek love?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.71,1:39:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是任何人都想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's all any of us want.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.01,1:39:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.34,1:39:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟敢转身而去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}dare you turn your back on me?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.60,1:39:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了 格尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've won, Gorr.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.56,1:39:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生命最后的时刻能陪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I spend my last moments with you…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.56,1:39:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必与你共度？\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I can be with her?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.31,1:39:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I choose love.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.02,1:39:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也能 你能救她回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can, too. You can bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.78,1:39:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,许你的愿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.69,1:40:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.52,1:40:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能照顾她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would have no one.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.40,1:40:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会孤单无依\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would be alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.49,1:40:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't be alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.94,1:41:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}My love.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.16,1:42:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've missed you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.96,1:42:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.13,1:42:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.55,1:42:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.63,1:42:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我举起那把锤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since I picked up that hammer…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.89,1:42:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's like…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.97,1:42:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我多了一条命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gotten an extra life.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.89,1:42:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那实在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.52,1:42:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很神奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}magical.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.90,1:42:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一个人类来说还不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not too bad for a human.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.61,1:42:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一个神也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not too bad for a god.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.11,1:42:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想到我的口号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I think I figured out my catchphrase.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.45,1:42:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么？　- 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? What is it? - Come close…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.00,1:42:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.34,1:43:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前最棒的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the best one yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.80,1:43:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.10,1:43:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续敞开你的心房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your heart open.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.85,1:43:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.52,1:43:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.70,1:44:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect her.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.74,1:44:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护我的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect my love.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.07,1:44:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我告诉你们一个太空维京人的传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you the legend of the Space Viking…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.70,1:44:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是女雷神 又名珍佛斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}AKA the Mighty Thor, AKA Dr. Jane Foster.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.12,1:45:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的牺牲拯救了宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her sacrifice saved the universe…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.75,1:45:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们了解什么叫活得有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}and taught us all what it means to be worthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.92,1:45:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她救了众神的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She helped the children of the gods…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.00,1:45:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们搭乘雷射光回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}who laser-beamed their way back home…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.47,1:45:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到从渔村变观光景点的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}to their dozy little fishing village turned tourist destination.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.47,1:45:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾克索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Axl!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.72,1:45:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.56,1:45:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？　- 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - I'm fine. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.97,1:45:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗？　- 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure? - I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.27,1:45:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,小朋友又变成天真的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids were safe to be kids again.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.85,1:45:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,大声点 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louder, three!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.86,1:45:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚站开一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Widen your stance.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.02,1:45:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其在国王逼他们上防身课之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially after their king made them all go to self-defense classes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.61,1:45:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看那些初出茅庐的太空维京人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all those budding Space Vikings.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.57,1:45:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the most important part.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.20,1:45:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,喊杀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The war cry!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.99,1:45:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连海姆达尔的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Heimdall's son…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.41,1:45:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾克索海姆达尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Axl Heimdallson…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.25,1:45:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在具有跟父亲一样的魔眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}who could now do his dad's freaky eye magic…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.62,1:45:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也成了一个小战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}was becoming quite the warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.92,1:45:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德的未来有希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future of Asgard was secure.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.88,1:45:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到未来 我正在开创自己的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of futures, I was forging one of my own…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.01,1:45:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟现在身体长回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}now that my body's grown back…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.38,1:45:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个叫杜恩的男生一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a dude I met called Dwayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.18,1:45:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问 那索尔呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about Thor, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.39,1:46:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔展开全新的旅程\N{\fnArial\fs30}He embarked on a new journey…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.68,1:46:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他发现生活目标 一个他爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he had found something to live for, something to love for.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.23,1:46:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人让他从悲伤之神变成老爸之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little someone who turned him from Sad God into Dad God.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.90,1:46:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,早餐上桌啰 慢用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breakfast is served.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.57,1:46:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈啰 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.70,1:46:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.08,1:46:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问一下 那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.74,1:46:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,燕麦煎饼 来自地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're pan-flaps. From Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.75,1:46:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢燕麦煎饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I like pan-flaps.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.75,1:46:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你很爱吃　- 不爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You love them. - No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.00,1:46:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你爱　- 我从来没吃过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, you do. - I've never had that in my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.00,1:46:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快吃 我们该走了 快迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Eat up. We have to go. We're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.71,1:46:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的靴子呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now where are your boots?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.88,1:46:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我穿好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm wearing them.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.17,1:46:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能穿那双\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not wearing those.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.51,1:46:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要　- 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I am. - No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.26,1:46:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.60,1:46:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.80,1:46:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧 恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell, demon!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.89,1:46:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.23,1:46:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,全新的 毁了 谢谢你喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brand new, now destroyed. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.06,1:46:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You wear what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.06,1:46:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚痛就别对我唉唉叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't come complaining to me when your feet get sore, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.07,1:46:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会同情你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get no sympathy here from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.03,1:46:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 我穿靴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, I'll wear the boots.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.40,1:46:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.45,1:46:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住我妈常说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what my mother used to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.36,1:46:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听大人的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to the grown-ups…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.53,1:47:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到有人害怕或被欺负\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you see anyone scared or being picked on…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.74,1:47:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就照顾他们 好吗？　- 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you look after them, okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.24,1:47:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的是 玩得开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And most of all, have fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.79,1:47:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 懂了　- 懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gotcha. - Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.50,1:47:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷神之锤呢？我放在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now where is Mjolnir? Where did I put him?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.67,1:47:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边 在床上睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there. Sleeping in the bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.00,1:47:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.75,1:47:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.22,1:47:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这洗不掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not coming off.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.76,1:47:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么好事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.35,1:47:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以前看起来好无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looked boring before.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.35,1:47:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Suppose it did.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.02,1:47:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.35,1:47:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有创意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very creative.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.73,1:47:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.36,1:47:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那边的外星人了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you see the aliens down there?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.73,1:47:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有条纹的　- 他们看起来是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The stripy ones? - They look nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.11,1:47:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 所以我们得照顾他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they are nice. That's why we have to look after them.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.07,1:47:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了 保护好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. Protect the nice ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.03,1:47:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 小甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.20,1:47:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 索尔叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you, Uncle Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.46,1:47:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们永远都会保护我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will always be there for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.12,1:47:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空维京人和诞生自永恒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Space Viking and his girl, born from Eternity.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.46,1:47:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有神力的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the powers of a god.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.26,1:47:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,两名战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two warriors…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.05,1:48:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为无力反抗的人打赢正义之战\N{\fnArial\fs30}fighting the good fight for those who can't fight good.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.85,1:48:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们周游宇宙 被取了许多名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have traveled far, and have been given many names.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.15,1:48:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对那些最了解他们的人来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to those who know them best…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.73,1:48:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就叫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}they are simply known…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.57,1:48:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱与雷霆\N{\fnArial\fs30}as Love and Thunder.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.74,1:48:21.12,Title,0,0,0,0,,《雷神4：爱与雷霆》
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.43,1:50:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,以往身为一个神 是有意义的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It used to be that being a god, it meant something.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.23,1:50:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们会轻唤你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}People would whisper your name…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.85,1:50:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,分享他们最真诚的希望与梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}before sharing their deepest hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.86,1:50:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们求你大发慈悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}They begged you for mercy…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.86,1:50:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,连你有没有在听都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}without ever knowing if you were actually listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.95,1:50:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.66,1:50:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们望着天空\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, they look to the sky…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.37,1:50:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不向我们求闪电\N{\fnArial\fs30}they don't ask us for lightning.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.29,1:50:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不向我们求雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't ask us for rain.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.33,1:50:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想到看所谓的超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just want to see one of their so-called superheroes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.97,1:50:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们何时成了笑话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did we become the joke?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.43,1:50:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.64,1:50:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能这样下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.64,1:50:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将再度畏惧我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will fear us again…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.73,1:51:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要索尔奥汀森死\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Thor Odinson falls from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.95,1:51:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听懂了吗 海克力士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand me, Hercules?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.32,1:51:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听懂了吗 儿子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand me, my son?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.03,1:51:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.94,1:58:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.53,1:58:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.03,1:58:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍佛斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane Foster.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.41,1:58:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heimdall.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.41,1:58:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you're dead now.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.54,1:58:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.42,1:58:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你照顾我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for looking after my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.17,1:58:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常欢迎你来到众神之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are very welcome here, to the land of the gods.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.55,1:58:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎莅临英灵殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Valhalla.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.64,1:58:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷神索尔将再度回归
